只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness 背景随当前模型而切换","id":"gh:1368139634","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-background-by-model","slug":"HarmlessFunny/dsh-background-by-model","topics":["dsh-background","dsh-plugin","dsh-wallpaper"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness 背景随当前模型而切换"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-background-by-model"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> Forked from `Tkingxiao/dsh-any-background` and renamed to `dsh-background-by-model`."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"A **DeepSeek Harness** appearance plugin built around an **ordered list of model rules**: each rule "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"carries its own images, and each image its own layout mode, framing, theme color, opacity, brightnes"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"s and blur. Switch the model and the background switches with it, through the global switch effect y"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"ou choose on the Config page."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> **v0.3.0 was a breaking release** — video wallpapers, generated backgrounds and the single global "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"theme color were removed. See the v0.3.0 entry in CHANGELOG.md."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## How Model Rules Work"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"A rule is a **match string** plus **one complete set of background settings**. On a model switch the"},{"id":"p8s2","text":" plugin reads the current session's model name, scans the list top-down, and applies the **first** r"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"ule whose match string appears anywhere in it (case-insensitive) — with **rule 1** as the fallback w"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"hen nothing matches."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Example list:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| # | Match string | Wallpaper |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| 1 | `deepseek` | Image A |\n| 2 | `flash` | Image B |\n| 3 | `glm` | Image C |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Current model | Result | Why |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| `DeepSeek-Flash` | Rule 1 → Image A | `deepseek` matches first |\n| `GLM-Flash` | Rule 2 → Image B "},{"id":"p13s2","text":"| `flash` is earlier in the list than `glm` |\n| `Qwen-Flash` | Rule 2 → Image B | `flash` matches |\n"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"| `GLM-Turbo` | Rule 3 → Image C | only `glm` matches |\n| `Kimi-K3` | Fallback → Rule 1 → Image A | "},{"id":"p13s4","text":"ule 3 → Image C | only `glm` matches |\n| `Kimi-K3` | Fallback → Rule 1 → Image A | no rule matches |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- **Order matters** — the first match wins, not the best match; drag rules to reorder them.\n- **An e"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"mpty match string** makes a rule skip matching and act purely as a fallback, so a single rule with a"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"n empty match string is \"one wallpaper everywhere\".\n- The match string is compared against **provide"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"r, model id and display name** concatenated, so any of the three can select a rule.\n- The current mo"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"del is read from **this session's durable model selection** (the `modelSelection` projection the com"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"poser's own picker renders), so switching models inside a session takes effect immediately; the page"},{"id":"p14s7","text":" shows what was read, and marks it **host default** when only the host-wide default was available."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"> The example above has **no `kimi`** entry, so Kimi falls back to rule 1 = Image A and looks like \""},{"id":"p15s2","text":"nothing happened\" — add a rule with the match string `kimi`."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"One interface, one config — only the current model differs:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"DeepSeek V4.1 Flash · matched the rule containing deepseek: a light wallpaper with a matching theme "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"eek V4.1 Flash · matched the rule containing deepseek: a light wallpaper with a matching theme color"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Kimi K2.7 Code · matched the rule containing kimi: a dark wallpaper, and the whole interface reskinn"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"Code · matched the rule containing kimi: a dark wallpaper, and the whole interface reskinned with it"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"One rule on the Model Background tab · the layout mode, the framing, the theme color and the opacity"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"/brightness/blur all belong to the image being edited"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Example wallpaper art from ZipZipPipe on bilibili"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Model rules"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"An ordered list of rules, matched first-hit against the current model's name, with rule 1 as the fal"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ered list of rules, matched first-hit against the current model's name, with rule 1 as the fallback."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- **Rules** — add, remove, reorder and name them; each carries its own match string, and a set of im"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ages with their own look.\n- **Images per rule** — a filmstrip filled by file picker, drag & drop or "},{"id":"p25s3","text":"a list of URLs; reorder it, promote one to first, or replace one in place (which keeps its position "},{"id":"p25s4","text":"in the rotation). A rule may also hold none, and an empty rule still matches while it has a theme co"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"lor of its own, so emptying one is a visible state rather than a trap.\n- **Live match readout** — th"},{"id":"p25s6","text":"e Model Background tab shows which model was read and which rule it resolved to.\n- **Import / export"},{"id":"p25s7","text":"** — the whole rule set as `dsh-background-by-model-theme.json` with every image inlined; files writ"},{"id":"p25s8","text":"ten by earlier releases still import.\n- **On disk, not in `localStorage`** — everything lives under "},{"id":"p25s9","text":"`~/.dsh/.dsh-background-by-model-data/`, and old single-wallpaper configs migrate in place on first "},{"id":"p25s10","text":"read.\n- **Bilingual**, with automatic locale detection, plus a theme watchdog that re-asserts the th"},{"id":"p25s11","text":"eme if the host resets it."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### Image rotation"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Per rule, and **off by default** — cycling spends real bandwidth, memory and battery, so nothing tur"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ff by default** — cycling spends real bandwidth, memory and battery, so nothing turns it on for you."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- **Dwell time** — 10 s / 30 s / 1 min / 5 min / 30 min, or any custom value in seconds (5 s – 24 h)"},{"id":"p28s2","text":".\n- **Order** — **In order** walks the list and wraps around; **Shuffle** picks among every image ex"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"cept the one on screen, so a tick never looks like it was missed.\n- **Also step on a model switch** "},{"id":"p28s4","text":"— a second trigger that runs no timer at all.\n- **Next image** — steps the wallpaper on demand, whet"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"her or not the timer is running.\n- **Only the active rule rotates**, on one timer for the whole plug"},{"id":"p28s6","text":"in; a hidden tab stops the rotation with the pixels."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### Switch effect (global)"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"What a wallpaper **change** looks like — one setting on the Config page, shared by every rule, cover"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"ing a model switch, a rotation step, **Next image** and a holiday taking over."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- **Four effects** — **Cross-fade** (the default), **Instant**, **Zoom in** and **Slide in**; zoom a"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"nd slide only animate `transform` on the incoming layer, so neither costs a byte of extra transfer.\n"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"- **Easing and one duration** — standard / linear / ease-out / ease-in-out, and `0`–`3000 ms` where "},{"id":"p31s4","text":"`0` is a hard cut rather than \"unset\". It replaced the per-rule `rotate.fadeMs`, which had no contro"},{"id":"p31s5","text":"l anywhere; a hand-tuned value is folded into it on first read.\n- **Reduced motion is a veto**, not "},{"id":"p31s6","text":"a shorter animation.\n- **The interface color fades on the same clock** — except a light↔dark flip, w"},{"id":"p31s7","text":"hich switches instantly, because interpolating between two palettes walks through mid-tones whose te"},{"id":"p31s8","text":"xt is unreadable in both directions.\n- **A preview swatch** replays the effect, because a wallpaper "},{"id":"p31s9","text":"fading into itself is invisible."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### Holiday backgrounds"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"One switch on the Config page and nothing else: on 中秋节 and 国庆节 the wallpaper switches to that holida"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"y's own art and theme color, and back the next morning. It ships **off**, and the recommended profil"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"d theme color, and back the next morning. It ships **off**, and the recommended profile turns it on."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
